CORE
main.c
--loop-contracts-file test_syntax_error.json --dfcc main --apply-loop-contracts
^file <predicate> line 1 function _fn: syntax error
^failed to parse the loop contracts for loop 0 of function foo given in the loop contracts file$
^EXIT=6$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A loop contract that does not parse, here because of a cast to a type name the
parser does not know, is reported as an error. It used to crash goto-instrument
with a segmentation fault, as the empty parse tree was dereferenced.
